/-!
# CLRS fourth edition

This is the canonical chapter tree for CLRS-Lean.  During the compatibility
period the guides reuse theorem-bearing modules whose paths follow the third
edition.  New work should start from a {lit}`CLRSLean.FourthEdition.Chapter_NN`
guide and consult {lit}`docs/clrs-fourth-edition-map.csv` before choosing a
section module.

The {lit}`FourthEdition` prefix is transitional.  At the cleanup major release,
unqualified {lit}`CLRSLean.Chapter_NN` paths will adopt fourth-edition meanings.
-/

